Service/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3642910,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3642910-1847286114033290","game_id":"steam-3642910","kind":"announcement","title":"Wyldheart Reaches 500k Wishlists & 170k Demo Players!","summary":"Hey everyone, We couldn't be more thrilled to share that not only has Wyldheart passed 500k wishlists on Steam, but we’ve officially had over 170k unique players try our demo. As a small indie team of around 10 developers, we could only ever dream of reaching this many people. Seeing so many of you pick up your weapons, build your characters and venture forth through the Whisperwoods has been absolutely amazing, and we can't thank you enough for your support. To everyone who has played the demo,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:00:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033290","verified_at":"2026-10-22T20:00:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3642910-1847286114032103","game_id":"steam-3642910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix 0.7.4","summary":"We made improvements to offline play sessions, fixed connectivity issues, stabilized quest and rumour progress, and removed two crashes.📡 Online, offline and reconnectingIf you start the game without an internet connection or with Steam in offline mode, the option to Play Online becomes available again as soon as your connection is back. You no longer have to restart the game.When you regain connection after a disconnect, the Reconnect button in the main menu will appear and show its progress.Th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:32:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032103","verified_at":"2026-10-22T14:22:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3642910-1846651706691344","game_id":"steam-3642910","kind":"announcement","title":"Unlock an exclusive demo background during Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey everyone!We're excited to reveal that Wyldheart will be taking part in Steam Next Fest. Play the demo and defeat the Many Crowned King in the Withered Keep to unlock an exclusive new character background, the Doomed Wayfinder, complete with an exclusive cape cosmetic and starting items.Once unlocked, this background is available to play in the Steam Next Fest demo, and best of all, it will carry over for use when Wyldheart launches into Early Access and 1.0.Whether you've already braved the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691344","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3642910-1846651706689762","game_id":"steam-3642910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix 0.7.3","summary":"Hotfix Notes Offline play & Local saveYou can now play and save your progress locally without an internet connection.You can disable “Play Online” in the main menu to create an offline solo campaign.Important: In this Demo, you cannot invite friends into an offline solo campaign, nor change the campaign into an online multiplayer campaign.You will now receive a warning on screen if your internet connection is disconnectedYou can now receive the demo reward even if you play offlineJoining into an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:13:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689762","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3642910-1846018067933240","game_id":"steam-3642910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix 0.7.2 CL39317","summary":"Hotfix Notes Server improvements: more reliable logins and reconnects, reduced server load, and preparation for increased capacity We’ve improved how Wyldheart communicates with our servers to make logins and reconnects more reliable and reduce unnecessary server traffic. We’ve also laid the groundwork to distribute players across more servers as the game grows. We expect these changes to improve connection stability. We’ll continue monitoring server performance closely and working on further im","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T13:04:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933240","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3642910-1846018067932793","game_id":"steam-3642910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix 0.7.2 CL39302","summary":"Demo Hotfix 0.7.2 CL39302 Fixes for: Join code is now visible in the Lobby/Roster when hosting \"Online Save\" checkbox in FrontEnd is now working as intended - this means you can now tick this box to play in offline mode if you're encountering connectivity or server issues. But please note offline saves are not supported in this demo so you will not be able to save progress /!\\\\ Server Maintenance planned today Hi everyone! Since yesterday’s demo launch, our servers have been struggling to keep u","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T10:08:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932793","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3642910-1846018067930481","game_id":"steam-3642910","kind":"announcement","title":"The Wyldheart Demo Is Available Now!","summary":"Greetings!At long last we can finally reveal that our first official Wyldheart demo is live right now, and it's yours to explore! If you missed the Triple-i showcase, don’t fret, you can catch our brand new trailer below for a first look at what's waiting for you in Caerwyn.This demo is a standalone one-shot experience packed with several hours of content, giving you a real taste of what a full campaign will feel like. In this demo, you can:Create your own unique character with 4 ancestries, 19 ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T16:40:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930481","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3642910-1843481262702191","game_id":"steam-3642910","kind":"announcement","title":"Wyldheart Is Featuring at Triple-i, October 8th!","summary":"Welcome!If you’re new here, we’re Wayfinder Studios, a small independent game studio mostly based in Sweden! We founded Wayfinder to build the kind of games we’ve always wanted to make together, beginning with our tabletop RPG-inspired co-op adventure, Wyldheart.Earlier this year we finally came out of stealth and revealed Wyldheart to the world. Now we’ve got another exciting announcement to share: Wyldheart Will Feature At The Triple-i Showcase! We're beyond excited to share that Wyldheart wil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T16:04:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702191","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3642910":{"last_attempt_at":"